abstract: >-
  CoWave (the LLM-ACCEL repository) is a synthesizable HLS and RTL hardware-emulation research
  prototype that separates model-aware decoder scheduling and memory state
  from regular streaming matrix/vector compute arrays. Published designs
  include two-CU Fix16 8x64 and four-CU W4A4 8x128 / W8A8 4x128 systems.
  It explores block-level streaming, controller-resident subgraphs, blocked
  prefill, online attention, resident KV-cache management, and cross-wave
  load/compute/collect overlap for Qwen-style decoder layers.
keywords:
  - FPGA
  - large language model
  - transformer accelerator
  - high-level synthesis
  - streaming architecture
  - online attention
